        <obo:IAO_0000112>The labels &apos;positive&apos; vs. &apos;negative&apos;, or &apos;left handed&apos;, &apos;right handed&apos;, &apos;ambidexterous&apos;, or &apos;strongly binding&apos;, &apos;weakly binding&apos; , &apos;not binding&apos;, or &apos;+++&apos;, &apos;++&apos;, &apos;+&apos;, &apos;-&apos; etc. form scales of categorical labels.</obo:IAO_0000112>
